WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:05.350
9 steps, and 5 of them are already silicon.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:14.710
SoC 1.0 ran 64 multiply accumulates on an Artix-7 at 125 megahertz, 3.3 frames a second,

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.910
whole frame, with defense revenue behind it.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:22.550
Each rung after it adds exactly one thing, and then measures the result.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:28.030
A floating point unit, the 8x8 weight stationary matrix, triple mode arithmetic, and then

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.550
the cube geometry itself.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.870
Watch the frame rate bars fill as the ladder climbs.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:43.750
SoC 2, the part this raise funds, is 32,768 multiply accumulates at 600 megahertz, 39.3

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:51.030
TOPS, about 41 frames a second on AD2, with tapeout in the fourth quarter of 2026.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.470
Note what is missing.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.070
SoC 3 was removed deliberately.
